OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's love of books helped
OL,4,Aauthor break stereotypes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn author who said she defied
OL,7,Fexpectations to write children's books
OL,8,Fbelieves her family's love of reading
OL,9,Fhelped her fulfil her dream.
OL,11,FNadia Shireen, from Wellington in
OL,12,FShropshire, has had a series of picture
OL,13,Fbooks published by Penguin, but recalls
OL,14,Fgrowing up at a time when people from
OL,15,Fsouth Asian backgrounds were rarely
OL,16,Fseen as writers.
OL,18,FShe said: "I was growing up in the 80's
OL,19,Fand authors were not people who like me
OL,20,For like my mum or dad.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
