OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's love of books helped
OL,4,Aauthor break stereotypes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If you were south Asian, you [were]
OL,7,Fobviously encouraged to get a good
OL,8,Feducation and get a steady [job],
OL,9,Fbecome a doctor, a lawyer, accountant,
OL,10,For any of those things," she added.
